--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
The call-argument pack expansion in a decltype operand was expanded only
when the decltype-specifier was the whole type, not when it was the
nested-name-specifier of `typename decltype(...)::type'; the call then had
a single argument.
